      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غُرْقَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A single draught</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَرْبَة</span> [in the CK <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شُرْبَة</span>])
